{{!
    @template tool_vae/precision_page

    The page "Demandes de précision", below its heading: what a request is, the declaration, the heading of the requests,
    one sentence when there is none, each question (its heading, author and time, text) and its answer or the word that it
    waits, then the form or the notice that the declaration is attested, and the way back to the dossier.

    Every text comes from the context, already worded by tool_vae\output\precision_page. The template holds no logic.
    Every text and address is escaped (double braces). Six keys are HTML (triple braces): declarationhtml, drawn by the
    template tool_vae/attest_declaration; headinghtml, a heading made by the core; questionhtml and answerhtml, the text
    typed passed through format_text() of the core as plain text; formhtml, the form of the core ($form->render());
    attestedhtml, a notification made by the core.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * intro - string, what a request is
    * declarationhtml - HTML, the declaration and the warning of its anchor
    * headinghtml - HTML, the heading of the requests
    * none - false, or a string: the sentence drawn when there is no request
    * requests - array of {questionheading, meta, questionhtml, waiting (false or a string), answer (false or {heading, date,
      answerhtml})}
    * formhtml - false, or HTML: the form
    * attestedhtml - false, or HTML: the notice that the declaration is attested
    * back - {url, label}: the way back to the dossier

    Example context (json):
    {
        "intro": "A manager asks; the vaeiste answers.",
        "declarationhtml": "<dl class=\"tool-vae-claim\"><dt>Record</dt><dd>RS5000-C01</dd></dl>",
        "headinghtml": "<h3>Requests</h3>",
        "none": false,
        "requests": [{"questionheading": "Question", "meta": "Hugo Bernard - 1 June 2026, 10:00",
            "questionhtml": "<div class=\"text_to_html\">Which shift?</div>", "waiting": false,
            "answer": {"heading": "Answer", "date": "2 June 2026, 10:00",
                "answerhtml": "<div class=\"text_to_html\">Night.</div>"} }],
        "formhtml": false,
        "attestedhtml": false,
        "back": {"url": "https://example.com/admin/tool/vae/dossier.php?userid=3", "label": "Back to the dossier"}
    }
}}
<p>{{intro}}</p>
{{{declarationhtml}}}
{{{headinghtml}}}
{{#none}}
<p>{{none}}</p>
{{/none}}
{{#requests}}
<h4 class="h5">{{questionheading}}</h4>
<p class="text-muted small">{{meta}}</p>
{{{questionhtml}}}
{{#waiting}}
<p class="text-muted">{{waiting}}</p>
{{/waiting}}
{{#answer}}
<h4 class="h5">{{heading}}</h4>
<p class="text-muted small">{{date}}</p>
{{{answerhtml}}}
{{/answer}}
{{/requests}}
{{#formhtml}}
{{{formhtml}}}
{{/formhtml}}
{{#attestedhtml}}
{{{attestedhtml}}}
{{/attestedhtml}}
{{#back}}
<p><a href="{{url}}">{{label}}</a></p>
{{/back}}
